                <invention-title lang="de">ABDOMINALES VERSCHLUSSVERFAHREN UND GERÄTEVARIANTEN ZUM VERSCHLIESSEN VON VENTRALEN HERNIEN UND ZUR REZIDIVREDUZIERUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ DE FERMETURE ABDOMINALE ET VARIANTES DE DISPOSITIFS POUR FERMER DES HERNIES VENTRALES ET RÉDUIRE LA RÉCURRENCE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ABDOMINAL CLOSURE METHOD AND DEVICE VARIATIONS FOR CLOSING VENTRAL HERNIAS AND REDUCING RECURRENCE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A combined magnetic and bioabsorbable device for ventral hernia closure and/or tension distribution for maintenance of tissue apposition for healing, while avoiding a long-term footprint of foreign material and precluding materials spanning the interior layer of the abdominal closure where risk to visceral structures exists.</p>
            </abstract>
